 of Review events that closes the Activity tab, with the six kinds of event it reads from the latest threads, as built from Adapter Widgets only.","interactionRules":["Each event is one sentence that names the actor and the place (a View and its Widget, or the Workspace), a link to its thread; a comment or reply shows an excerpt of its text, a resolution its kind, a reopening its reason, and every event its time ago.","The list reads the latest threads live and shows the newest events across them; it is separate from the version timeline, which never carries Review events, and an actor the thread does not name is shown as an agent or as someone."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"2e2f88d6-7a95-424a-b3d4-4661d811ef13"},{"relation":"timeline","type":"view","viewId":"f6a2d104-8b3c-4d4e-9f50-6a7b8c9d0e04"}],"requirements":["01a11e0d-db86-7890-ac42-5b4079364ad2","01a11a5e-0873-7976-8a48-a9a1a00e4b6d"]},"variants":{}}
